  #line-at(72.024pt, 682.18pt, "Zheng et al. reported that the CV curves of electric double-layer capacitors (EDLCs) typically exhibit ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 694.9pt, "a nearly rectangular shape, characteristic of non-faradaic charge storage. In contrast, the CV curves of ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 707.5pt, "our EDLCs displayed distinct redox peaks similar to those of the single-layer electrodes but with ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 720.22pt, "enhanced capacitance. The heterostructured electrodes revealed combined electrochemical ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 732.82pt, "characteristics of NiO and ZnO, with broader redox peaks indicating interfacial charge transfer between ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 745.416pt, "the two oxides ")
